# Polymarket Sports (the storefront) config. Copy to backend/.env.

# --- Ingest from the brain (wallet-dashboard) ---------------------------------
# Shared bearer token the brain must present to POST /api/copy/ingest. Leave blank
# only for local/dev (then ingest is unauthenticated).
COPY_INGEST_TOKEN=

# --- Telegram delivery --------------------------------------------------------
# LEGACY/global config — now superseded by the PER-USER Telegram each account sets in the
# app (Telegram tab). Each new/upgraded entry fans out to every verified user's own bot.
# These env vars are no longer used for delivery; kept only for backward reference.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# --- Accounts / sessions ------------------------------------------------------
# The whole dashboard requires login. Sessions are server-side; the cookie is Secure by
# default (HTTPS only). For LOCAL http dev set this to 0 so the cookie works over http.
SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE=1
# Optional tuning (defaults shown):
# SESSION_TTL_DAYS=30
# VERIFY_TTL_HOURS=24
# RESET_TTL_HOURS=1
# PASSWORD_MIN_LEN=8
# Reenvio do e-mail de confirmação: cooldown de 60s, no máx. 3 por janela; a janela desliza
# (VERIFY_RESEND_RESET_S) e zera a contagem, deixando o usuário tentar de novo depois.
# VERIFY_RESEND_COOLDOWN_S=60
# VERIFY_RESEND_MAX=3
# VERIFY_RESEND_RESET_S=3600

# --- E-mail (verification + password reset) via Resend ------------------------
# Get a key at resend.com and verify a sender domain. Without RESEND_API_KEY the app runs
# in DEV mode: the verification/reset links are printed to the backend log (stderr) instead
# of being e-mailed — handy for local testing.
RESEND_API_KEY=
EMAIL_FROM=Polymarket Sports <onboarding@resend.dev>
# Base URL the e-mail links point to (the FRONTEND origin). Dev default: http://localhost:5173
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5173

# --- Storage ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Users, sessions, tokens and per-user Telegram live in the SAME file as the entries.
# SPORTS_ENTRIES_DB=
